---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — OVIRO" description="OVIRO is a social-first creative agency built around attention, relevance, and community.">
  <div id="top" class="page-shell">
    <Header />
    <main>
      <section class="inner-hero inner-hero--lime">
        <p class="eyebrow">About / OVIRO</p>
        <h1>Social is not<br /><em>a side channel.</em></h1>
        <p class="inner-hero__intro">It is where brands are discovered, discussed, remixed, and remembered. That is where OVIRO works.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="beliefs section-pad" aria-labelledby="beliefs-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our point of view</p>
        <h2 id="beliefs-title">Make the brand useful<br />to the conversation.</h2>
        <div class="belief-grid">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>Earn attention</h3><p>Attention follows ideas with a clear reason to exist.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Think in systems</h3><p>A recognisable rhythm beats one lucky post.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Stay human</h3><p>Brands become relevant when they listen and respond with character.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Keep moving</h3><p>Social changes daily. The core stays clear while the expression evolves.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-note section-pad">
        <p>Company story, location, and team profiles will be added after OVIRO supplies the approved facts.</p>
        <a class="text-link text-link--light" href="/contact">Meet us through a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
